# oracle: bond_style harmonic across a periodic x boundary (w60fix_bond_image): six two-atom bonds whose partner
# lies at separations 11.0, 10.0, 9.0, 8.0, 7.0 from the owner atom (and one bond owned by the atom at x = 9.0), periodic box
# with comm cutoff at its default: native uses the closest ghost image of the partner, else the atom as stored
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units lj
atom_style bond
boundary p p p
region box block 0 12 0 30 0 12 units box
create_box 1 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 2
mass * 1.0
pair_style zero 2.0
pair_coeff * *
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 1.0 1.0
create_atoms 1 single 0.5 1.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 11.0 1.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 0.5 3.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 10.0 3.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 0.5 5.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 9.0 5.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 0.5 7.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 8.0 7.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 0.5 9.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 7.0 9.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 9.0 11.0 5.0 units box
create_atoms 1 single 0.5 11.0 5.0 units box
create_bonds single/bond 1 1 2
create_bonds single/bond 1 3 4
create_bonds single/bond 1 5 6
create_bonds single/bond 1 7 8
create_bonds single/bond 1 9 10
create_bonds single/bond 1 11 12
thermo_style custom step pe ebond
thermo_modify format float %.15g norm no
run 0
